1. UI & Visual Identity Layer (Front-End Architecture)
Normal projects boring aur purane dikhte hain, par humne ise ek Enterprise Cyberpunk/Sci-Fi Medical Suite ka look diya hai:

Custom Glassmorphic CSS: Standard Streamlit ke default white/gray layout ko hata kar humne unique dark glowing borders, custom tab styling, aur high-end font matrices (JetBrains Mono aur Inter) inject kiye hain.

Dynamic Image Base64 Encoding: Jo images (heart.jpg aur heart2.jpg) aapne folder mein rakhi hain, hamara code unhe binary tokens (base64) mein convert karta hai aur piche background layers aur animated dashboard lens frames ke roop mein render kar deta hai.

2. Multi-Tab Modular System (The 5 Core Features)
Project ko bada dikhane ke liye humne ise pure functional units mein divide kiya hai:

Tab 1: Single-Patient Telemetry & Research Simulator
Normal Mode: Jab clinician ya doctor real-time inputs (jaise Age, BP, Cholesterol) manually sliders aur forms se change karta hai, toh engine output generate karta hai.

Research Simulator Node: Agar data nahi hai, toh sidebar se is switch ko dabate hi algorithm Gaussian Randomization trigger karta hai. Yeh real-world environments ki tarah random but clinically possible health configurations simulate kar deta hai taaki pipeline test ho sake.

Tab 2: Bulk Processing Node (Multi-Patient Batch Processing)
Agar hospital mein ek sath 50 patients ka data aaya, toh doctor ek-ek karke slider nahi ghumayega.

Humne yahan ek Stream Input Parser lagaya hai. Jaise hi user .csv file upload karta hai, code Python ke pandas dataframes ka use karke pure data ko tabular array mein load karta hai, background loop chalata hai, aur saare patients ka risk ek single click mein side-by-side compute karke de deta hai.

Tab 3: Longitudinal Patient Archive (SQLite Database)
Jab bhi Tab 1 par "Execute" button dabaya jata hai, piche background mein SQLite3 Database Engine trigger hota hai.

Yeh ek safe local database file (vanguard_patient_vault.db) banata hai aur patient ke unique ID ke sath unka name, time, aur calculated risk score insert (INSERT INTO) kar deta hai.

Jab aap wahi ID search karte ho, toh database se data fetch hota hai aur Plotly Interactive Engine us historical timeline ka ek linear trajectory graph bana deta hai, jisse doctor ko pata chale ki patient ki halat sudhar rahi hai ya bigad rahi hai.

Tab 4: Explainable AI (XAI) Matrix
Healthcare mein sirf prediction kaafi nahi hoti, doctor ko "Kyun?" ka jawab chahiye hota hai.

Humne yahan ek customized Localized Feature Attribution Layer lagayi hai jo SHAP/LIME algorithms ki tarah kaam karti hai. Yeh check karti hai ki kaun sa vector parameter (jaise ST Slope ya Chest Pain) target hyperplane ke sabse kareeb tha aur uske impact ratio ko ek dynamic horizontal gauge bar graph mein display kar deti hai.

3. The Math Behind Prediction (The Dynamic Sigmoid Calibrator)
Aapne notice kiya hoga ki aapka machine learning model (knn_heart_model.pkl) kuch cases mein boundaries par lock ho jata hai (ya direct 0% ya 100% de deta hai). Professional medical AI mein kabhi bhi 0% ya 100% risk nahi diya jata, kyunki clinical science mein hamesha uncertainty hoti hai.

